{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:08 2026-11-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:08 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:08 2026-11-19 HKT</p><p>許志安為TVB台慶壓軸演出後受訪，問到會否驚與馬國明同場感到尷尬，安仔直言不會尷尬，畢竟已隔了很久，不再講返以前，順其自然，會過去的。</p><img alt=\"許志安開腔談馬明。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/712c136f56deaaa163644c594be7ed0b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_21_16_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"他堅持事件會過去的。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/87b727494ba7dfb11f5811680b47a088/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_21_16_00_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"不再講返以前，順其自然。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8b01e027b3fe4420f0af9e131e550cba/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_21_16_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"安仔不會感到尷尬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b2bd0ecb88262e541700625ff6f04dd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_21_16_01_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"安仔大唱經典歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b5c5892a3923bc0083fd3c2f72b7388a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_23_03_10.jpg\"/><img alt=\"安仔壓軸演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b8967d371c65add486e09fc7ce3a8c8c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_22_10_22_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬明見安仔演出時卻刻意避席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c98085d61030216162290a28081cf50e/2026-11/thumbnail_10_.jpg\"/><h2>許志安自爆想同汪阿姐相認</h2><p>談到再為台慶演出，安仔憶起以前一班華星歌手一齊參演耍劍環節，又為「阿姐」汪明荃伴舞《熱咖啡》，笑言要同阿姐相認，坦言有很多美好回憶。對於早前演出爵士音樂會被周啟生狠批，安仔認為對方可能想他有進步，也可能有誤會，安仔指這次獲邀演出是大會想透過他的流行曲聯乘爵士樂，若以純爵士樂演出就不需找他，不過每次演出後都會事後檢討，希望有進步，以後演出做得更好。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.493656+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:08:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:38:00.384814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:55.209860+00:00","content_hash":"fe63ed00ba3f6f1b5653fb4cf0b8dff6d032222572521f58be6f3739a19c470b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}